    },
    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U06-L16-ACTIVITY-012",
      "SourceSection": "16.2: Any Period",
      "SourceExcerpt": "What is the period of the function \\(y=\\cos(\\pi \\theta)\\)? Explain your reasoning.",
